flowchart LR
    User[User query] --> Agent[LangGraph matching agent]
    Agent --> Decide[Decide action]
    Decide --> Parse[Parse job description]
    Parse --> Match[Extract requirements and rank]
    Match --> Report[Generate report]
    Decide --> Report
    Agent --> Client[MCP filesystem client]
    Client --> Init[initialize JSON-RPC session]
    Init --> Discovery[tools/list or resources/list]
    Discovery --> Call[tools/call or resources/read]
    Call --> Server[filesystem_mcp_server.py]
    Server --> Files[(Resume files)]
    Files --> Server
    Server --> Call
    Call --> Client
    Client --> Agent
    Report --> Feedback[Human feedback and next query]
    Feedback --> Agent